# Google Calendar OAuth "Desktop app" client, baked into the build so users
# don't have to create their own. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the
# values from Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials.
#
# These are a PUBLIC (non-confidential) desktop client: they ship inside the
# installer by design, and PKCE is what secures the sign-in flow. Do NOT put a
# web-app client secret, service-account key, or API key here.
#
# `.env` is gitignored. Keep the real values in your build machine / CI secrets,
# not in git (Google's scanners auto-reset secrets committed to public repos).
ALPINE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
ALPINE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
